      en: ["UNESCO recognized its climate in 1982", "Named after General José de Villamil", "Located in Guayas Province on the Pacific coast", "Major hub for traditional artisanal fishing", "Ranked as having the world's second-best climate", "Primary beach destination for Guayaquil residents"],
